{
  "id": "/",
  "short_name": "Iron Rabbit",
  "name": "Iron Rabbit - Offline Notes & Reminders",
  "description": "Iron Rabbit is a fast, offline-first productivity app. Capture daily / weekly / monthly notes, tick off chores in Kid Mode, plan meals, run a smart shopping list, keep a shared pantry, dictate voice notes, and set reminders — all stored on your device with IndexedDB. Nothing leaves your phone unless you export a backup. Works fully offline, syncs when you want to, and installs as a native-feeling PWA.",
